  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Before fighting Qin Bai Sheng, Feng Jiu Ge names the song and asks him to enjoy it.",
      "chapters": [
        766
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_sheng",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qin Bai Sheng confirms the immortal killer move by that name while spitting green blood that hardens into jade pearls. A wide domain turns soil and reeds into green jade, and jade will spreads through the target: clothes, hair, and skin freeze toward jade while contaminated jade blood impedes flow. Qin Bai Sheng lasting fifteen minutes is rare; organ defenses are what keep him from dying outright. Central Continent Gu Immortals treat the jade battlefield as proof they could not take even one of his attacks, and note this song as only one of six then known.",
      "chapters": [
        768
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "confirmation-and-effects",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At a critical moment Feng Jiu Ge casts it as an extraordinary sound path killer move and forces He Lang Zi and Hui Feng Zi back.",
      "chapters": [
        886
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "casts-and-voice",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_he_lang_zi",
        "char_hui_feng_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When he later sings before Qin Bai Sheng again, green jade song sounds crisp and sharp, like beads of flawless jade, before he moves on to heaven and earth song and submission song.",
      "chapters": [
        898
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "casts-and-voice",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Against five Shadow Sect immortals the move slowly turns bodies into spreading jade until they cut or dig out contaminated flesh; among Feng Jiu Ge’s three trump cards it sits second after heaven and earth song and before submission song.",
      "chapters": [
        923
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "casts-and-voice",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shadow_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Against year beasts the song corrodes them into green jade stone and shatters charging forms into jade pieces; Fang Yuan judges it stronger than at Luo Po Valley after Feng Jiu Ge’s improvements.",
      "chapters": [
        1401
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "casts-and-voice",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_luo_po_valley"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside the River of Time an immemorial tiger year beast breaks jade on its claw easily, and the song is suppressed to the limit even though Feng Jiu Ge’s sound path dao marks already support rank eight battle strength at rank seven cultivation.",
      "chapters": [
        1404
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "casts-and-voice",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_river_of_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A green jade song warrior can form from the move, hold power so reverse flow protection seal reflects nothing useful, distract without attacking Fang Yuan, and turn Hei Lou Lan’s angry bird into shattering jade birds; among four offensive songs it stands with heaven and earth song, submission song, and separation song.",
      "chapters": [
        1421
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "song-clone-distracts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Lang Ya blessed land a full cast freezes roughly a hundred li of cloud, soil, and water into jade and briefly statues the silver giant; the song has rank eight power there but only obstructs that giant temporarily.",
      "chapters": [
        1545
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "giant-freeze-and-standing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among seven songs then held, green jade song remains a major-fight trump card with heaven and earth song, submission song, and separation song.",
      "chapters": [
        1546
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "giant-freeze-and-standing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
